  "recordedAt": "2026-03-26T15:00:00Z",
  "contextText": "Re-planning the pilot timeline after the sensor delays.",
  "hasTranscript": true,
  "speakers": [
    {
      "id": "m12-spk-a",
      "label": "A",
      "displayName": "Alex Rivera"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-spk-b",
      "label": "B",
      "displayName": "Sarah Chen"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-spk-c",
      "label": "C",
      "displayName": "Tomás Aguilar"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-spk-d",
      "label": "D",
      "displayName": "Owen Barker"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m12-s001",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 7060,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks for making time. I think we all know why we're here, the aisle sensors are late."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s002",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-c",
      "startMs": 7310,
      "endMs": 15510,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Yes. The supplier slipped the delivery by five weeks. We can't run the pilot without location data from the sensors."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s003",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-b",
      "startMs": 15760,
      "endMs": 22820,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "So let's be honest about the timeline. The pilot moved to Q2. I've already told NWR's board."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s004",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-d",
      "startMs": 23070,
      "endMs": 25570,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "How did they take it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s005",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-b",
      "startMs": 25820,
      "endMs": 30980,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Fine. NWR's board cares that it works, not that it's in Q1."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s006",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 31230,
      "endMs": 36770,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Then let's pick a real date. What's the earliest go-live in Building 3?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s007",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-c",
      "startMs": 37020,
      "endMs": 43700,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "If the sensors land mid April, installation takes about a week, then a week of calibration."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s008",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-d",
      "startMs": 43950,
      "endMs": 47590,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That puts us at the start of May."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s009",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-b",
      "startMs": 47840,
      "endMs": 53760,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Then we go live in Building 3 on May 4. Let's commit to that."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s010",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 54010,
      "endMs": 56130,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "May 4 go-live, agreed."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s011",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-d",
      "startMs": 56380,
      "endMs": 58880,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Agreed from the platform side."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s012",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 59130,
      "endMs": 63150,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Tomás, the install plan is the next dependency, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s013",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-c",
      "startMs": 63400,
      "endMs": 68180,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Yes. I'll finalize the aisle sensor install plan by next Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s014",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-d",
      "startMs": 68430,
      "endMs": 73210,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Send it to me as well, it affects the network work."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s015",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-c",
      "startMs": 73460,
      "endMs": 74820,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Will do."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s016",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 75070,
      "endMs": 79090,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Anything we should do differently with the extra time?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s017",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-d",
      "startMs": 79340,
      "endMs": 85640,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Use it for load testing. I'd like to see the service under peak-season order volumes."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s018",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 85890,
      "endMs": 90670,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Good idea. JJ can build a replay of last November's orders."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s019",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-b",
      "startMs": 90920,
      "endMs": 94180,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Do that. November is our worst month."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s020",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 94430,
      "endMs": 99590,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Sarah, how are you doing? You mentioned a big race coming up."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s021",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-b",
      "startMs": 99840,
      "endMs": 107280,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The Berlin marathon in September. I'm running it for the first time, so my mornings are mostly training."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s022",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 107530,
      "endMs": 111930,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Good luck. We'll keep the Friday updates coming as usual."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s023",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-b",
      "startMs": 112180,
      "endMs": 116960,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Please do. And copy Owen now that platform sits with him."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s024",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 117210,
      "endMs": 118570,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Will do."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s025",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-c",
      "startMs": 118820,
      "endMs": 123980,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "One last thing, the supplier has promised weekly status. I'll forward those."
    },
    {
      "id": "m12-s026",
      "speakerId": "m12-spk-a",
      "startMs": 124230,
      "endMs": 129010,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Perfect. So: Q2, May 4 go-live, install plan by next Tuesday."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Northwind pilot re-plan\n\n**Date:** March 26\n**Attendees:** Alex Rivera (Larkspur Labs), Sarah Chen (Northwind Robotics), Tomás Aguilar (Northwind Robotics), Owen Barker (Northwind Robotics)\n\n## Summary\n\nThe aisle sensor supplier slipped delivery by five weeks, and the pick-path pilot cannot run without sensor location data. The group re-planned the timeline.\n\n## Timeline\n\n- The pilot moved to Q2. Sarah has already told NWR's board, who care that it works rather than that it lands in Q1.\n- Sensors are expected mid April; installation takes about a week, followed by a week of calibration.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- **Go live in Building 3 on May 4.**\n- Use the extra time for load testing at peak-season order volumes, using a replay of last November's orders — Northwind's worst month.\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Tomás Aguilar** — finalize the aisle sensor install plan by next Tuesday and share it with Owen, since it affects the network work.\n- **Tomás Aguilar** — forward the supplier's weekly status updates.\n- **JJ** — build a replay of last November's orders for load testing.\n- **Alex Rivera** — continue the Friday updates and copy Owen.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Sarah is running the Berlin marathon in September for the first time; her mornings are mostly training.\n"
  },
